\p
\v 2 Then¦202171 Shelomoh¦202173 \add !(Solomon¦202173)\add* assembled¦202172 the¦202176 Israeli elders¦202176, and¦202178 all¦202180 the¦202182 heads¦202182 of¦202182 the¦202183 tribes¦202183, the¦202184 Israeli \add ≈clan leaders¦202184\add*, in Yerushalem¦202190 \add !(Jerusalem¦202190)\add*, to¦202191 bring¦202191 the¦202194 box¦202194 \add ≈containing\add* Yahweh's¦202197 agreement¦202195 up¦202191 \add the hill\add* from¦202198 the¦202198 city¦202198 of¦202198 David¦202199, that¦202200 is¦202201, Tsiyon¦202201 \add !(Zion¦202201)\add*.\x + \xo 5:2: \xt 2Sam 6:12-15; 1Ch 15:25-28.\x*
\v 3 \add ≈So¦202203 in October,\add* all¦202207 those Israeli¦202210 leaders gathered¦202203 to¦202204 be with the¦202206 king¦202206 for a feast,
