\v 6 Then¦202247 King¦202247 Shelomoh¦202248, and¦202249 all¦202249 the¦202251 assembled Israelis¦202252 with him, gathered¦202253 in¦202255 front¦202255 of¦202255 the¦202256 box¦202256, sacrificing¦202257 sheep¦202258 and¦202259 cattle¦202259 which¦202260 were¦202263 too many to count¦202263.
\v 7 The¦202269 priests¦202269 then¦202268 took¦202268 the¦202272 box¦202272 \add ≈containing\add* Yahweh's¦202275 agreement¦202273 in to¦202276 its¦202278 place in the¦202281 house's¦202282 inner¦202281 room¦202281 (the¦202285 \add ≈holiest place¦202285\add*)—to¦202287 under¦202289 the¦202290 winged creatures,
