\v 10 There¦202333 was¦202333 nothing in¦202334 the box¦202334 except the¦202336 two¦202336 \add stone\add* tablets¦202337 that¦202338 Mosheh¦202341 \add !(Moses¦202341)\add* had¦202340 \add ≈put¦202340 in\add* at¦202342 Horev¦202342,\x + \xo 5:10: \xt Deu 10:5.\x* which¦202338 \add represented the agreement that\add* Yahweh¦202345 \add ≈had made¦202344 with¦202346 the¦202348 Israelis¦202349 after\add* they'd¦202350 left¦202350 Mitsrayim¦202351 \add !(Egypt¦202351)\add*.
