\v 13 The trumpeters¦202396 and¦202398 singers¦202398 performed together to¦202403 praise¦202403 and¦202404 thank¦202404 Yahweh¦202405, with¦202408 the trumpets¦202408 and¦202409 cymbals¦202409 on the¦202410 highlights of¦202410 the¦202411 song¦202411 to¦202413 praise Yahweh¦202413:
