\s4 Southern kingdom
\p
\v 10 All¦207372 the¦207374 \add ≈surrounding¦207377\add* kingdoms¦207374 \add ≈were afraid\add* of Yahweh¦207370, \add ≈so¦207379\add* they¦207380 didn't¦207379 \add ≈attack\add* Yehoshafat¦207383 \add !(Jehoshaphat¦207383)\add*.
\v 11 \add ≈Some\add* of the¦207387 Pelishtim¦207387 brought¦207388 tribute¦207390 to¦207389 Yehoshafat¦207389, \add ≈including¦207391 lots of\add* silver¦207391. Also¦207393, the¦207394 Aravim¦207394 brought¦207395 him¦207396 flocks¦207397 \add totalling\add* 7,700 rams¦207398 and 7,700 goats¦207403.
\v 12 \add ≈So¦207410\add* Yehoshafat¦207411 \add ≈continued to become¦207413 more powerful¦207413\add*, and¦207417 he¦207417 built¦207417 palaces in¦207418 Yehudah¦207418 \add !(Judah¦207418)\add*, as well as storehouses¦207421 in the cities¦207420.
\v 13 He \add ≈accumulated many supplies\add* in¦207427 Yehudah's¦207428 cities¦207427.
\p He \add also\add* had \add ≈many powerful warriors\add* in¦207433 Yerushalem¦207433 \add !(Jerusalem¦207433)\add*.
\v 14 \add ≈These¦207435 are¦207436 the leaders and numbers from each tribe\add*:
