\p
\v 28 \add ≈So¦208074\add* Yisrael's¦208077 \add !(Israel¦208077)\add* King¦208079 \add Ahav\add* and Yehudah's¦208081 \add !(Judah¦208081)\add* king Yehoshafat¦208078 \add !(Jehoshaphat¦208078)\add* went to Ramot¦208084-Gilead¦208085.
