\v 8 Yehoshafat¦208341 also¦208338 appointed¦208340 some¦208342 Levites¦208344 and¦208345 priests¦208345 in Yerushalem, as well as \add ≈leaders\add* from some¦208346 Israeli¦208348 families, to \add ≈be judges¦208349\add* \add ≈on Yahweh's¦208350 behalf based in\add* Yerushalem¦208353,
