\v 31 Yehoshafat¦209011 \add !(Jehoshaphat¦209011)\add* was thirty-five \add ≈years¦209019 old\add* when¦209020 he¦209020 became¦209020 king¦209020, and he¦209024 reigned¦209024 over¦209012 Yehudah¦209014 \add !(Judah¦209014)\add* from Yerushalem¦209025 \add !(Jerusalem¦209025)\add* for twenty-five years. His¦209027 mother¦209027 was Shilhi's¦209031 daughter¦209029, Azuvah¦209028.
\v 32 He¦209033 \add ≈had similar priorities to his¦209035 father¦209035 Asa¦209036, doing¦209041 what pleased\add* Yahweh¦209044, and¦209037 he¦209039 didn't¦209037 \add ≈deviate\add* from¦209040 that.
