\v 34 \add ≈Everything else that¦209072 Yehoshafat¦209062 did, from the¦209063 beginning to the¦209064 end\add* \add of his reign\add*, was¦209066 written¦209066 down by Hanani's¦209071 son¦209069 Yehu¦209068 \add !(Jehu¦209068)\add* in the¦209076 scroll¦209076 about Yisrael's¦209078 \add !(Israel¦209078)\add* kings¦209077.
