\v 6 \add @Uziyah¦211549\add* went¦211549 to attack¦211550 the Pelishtim¦211551, and¦211552 \add successfully\add* broke¦211552 through the walls at Gat, Yavneh, and Ashdod¦211562. He¦211563 \add ≈rebuilt¦211563\add* Ashdod¦211565 \add ≈and¦211566 other\add* cities¦211564 in¦211565 the Peleshet \add region\add*.
