\v 16 \add ≈However,\add* \add at the peak of\add* his¦211742 strength¦211742, he \add ≈became very arrogant¦211743, and that led to his\add* destruction. He¦211748 \add ≈disobeyed\add* his¦211750 god¦211750 Yahweh and¦211751 went¦211751 into¦211752 the¦211754 \add ≈temple¦211754\add* to¦211756 burn¦211756 incense on¦211757 the¦211759 incense altar¦211759.
