\v 18 They¦211775 \add ≈confronted\add* King¦211779 Uziyah¦211778 and¦211780 \add ≈challenged\add* him, “It's not¦211782 \add permitted\add* for¦211784 you, Uziyah¦211785, to¦211786 sacrifice to¦211787 Yahweh¦211787, only for¦211788 Aharon's¦211792 \add !(Aaron¦211792)\add* descendants¦211790 the priests¦211789—the ones consecrated¦211793 to¦211794 sacrifice.\x + \xo 26:18: \xt Exo 30:7-8; Num 3:10.\x* Leave¦211795 the¦211798 sanctuary¦211798, because¦211799 you've¦211800 \add ≈disobeyed\add* Yahweh¦211805 God¦211806, \add ≈so now\add* he won't honour¦211804 you.”
\p
