\v 27 Then¦212623 Ahaz¦212624 \add ≈died\add*\x + \xo 28:27: \xt Isa 14:28.\x* and¦212628 was buried¦212628 in¦212629 ‘The City¦212629 of David’, but not¦212632 in the¦212634 tombs¦212634 of¦212634 the¦212635 \add other\add* kings¦212635 of¦212635 Yisrael¦212636. Then¦212637 his¦212640 son¦212639 Hizkiyah¦212638 \add !(Hezekiah¦212638)\add* \add ≈replaced him as king¦212637\add*.
