\v 9 The¦216310 Levite leaders¦216310 Konaniyah¦216302 and¦216304 his younger brothers¦216306 Shemayah¦216304 and¦216305 Netanel¦216305, along with Hashavyah¦216307, Yeiel¦216308, and¦216309 Yozavad¦216309, \add together\add* contributed¦216312 five¦216315 thousand¦216316 lambs and¦216317 three hundred¦216319 bulls¦216317.
