\v 11 Tsidkiyah¦216856 \add !(Zedekiah¦216856)\add* was twenty-one when¦216857 he¦216857 became¦216857 king¦216857, and¦216858 he¦216861 reigned¦216861 from Yerushalem¦216862 \add !(Jerusalem¦216862)\add* for eleven years.\x + \xo 36:11: \xt Jer 27:1-22; 28:1-17.\x*
