\v 15 \add ≈So¦216923\add* Yahweh¦216924, their¦216926 ancestors'¦216926 god¦216925, \add ≈sent¦216923 many messages via his¦216929 prophets,\add* because¦216932 he¦216934 felt compassion¦216934 for his¦216937 people¦216937 and¦216938 his¦216940 residence¦216940,
